an4.50:11.4 | S: some ascetics and brahmins | T: some brahmans & contemplatives
an4.50:11.5 | S: don’t shine or glow. | T: don’t glow, don’t shine,
an4.50:11.6 | S: Impure, dirty creatures, | T: are impure, dusty, dead.
an4.50:12.1 | S: swathed in darkness, | T: Covered with darkness,
an4.50:12.2 | S: bondservants of craving, full of attachments, | T: slaves to craving, led on,
an4.50:12.3 | S: swell the horrors of the charnel ground, | T: they swell the terrible charnel ground,
an4.50:12.4 | S: taking up future lives.” | T: they grab at further becoming.
an4.50:12.5 | P: Dasamaṁ. | T: (none)
an4.50:12.6 | P: Rohitassavaggo pañcamo. | T: (none)
